{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はライブリハでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンけっこう久しぶりだったのー\n汗かいたよー\n本当楽しいわー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん、とまと♡2012.12.14"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ちっちゃくみなみ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんにちょっかい出すのっ♪\nにゃんがなんか食べてたら\n奪って食べやるんだぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまともいじる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「なんでよー」って言うの、かわいい\nあとときどき野太い声出るところも\nかわいい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ともおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわかわいい、だいすきっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン終わりに\n恒例のケーキ争奪戦が始まった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんととまと、\n12日誕生日だったねねを\nみんなでお祝いしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺美味しすぎました。\nやっぱ苺だな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、すきな食べ物いちご\nとかすごく可愛く見えるけど、\nそういうことじゃなくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で苺すきなんだよ！\n果物としてすきなんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニ寄ったら限定の\nいちご味のお菓子多すぎて...\nこの季節に困るわよ！\n生がいちばんだけど........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも我慢だああああくっそおおおおおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなんの話してんだ。\n長々と語っちゃったじゃないか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46センター試験が\n開催されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日替わりでメンバーからの問題が\n出るみたいだけどー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余裕だよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日夜眠れなくて絵描いてたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/9899213/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}